Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.25,0:00:07.57,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,This traditional Annovazzi hairpin \Ncarries a certain secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.99,0:00:11.99,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,When worn on a hand, it becomes a weapon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.99,0:00:16.00,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,called a knuckle duster \Nthat increases the force of blows.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:36.51,sign_Georgia,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFEFEFD&\an8\fs40\c&H1B1A20&\shad0\bord4\fad(1782,1)}Always a {\c&H8971F4&}Catch!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.53,0:01:35.36,sign_Arial,,0,0,0,,{\an8\move(20,320,330,320)\c&H303637&\3c&HECF6F5&\fs8\frz-4.09\shad0}Knight Captain
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.00,0:01:51.01,sign_Georgia,,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,65)\c&H141722&\bord4\shad0\fs27\3c&HF4F3FC&}Episode 7
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.00,0:01:51.01,sign_Georgia,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(319,260)\fs22\c&H080600&\bord0\shad0}The {\c&H8B74F6&\fs27}Fists {\fs22\c&H20222A&}of the {\c&HCD9F59&}One {\c&H20222A&}That Got Away
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.01,0:01:55.30,main,MIMI DAD,0,0,0,,Hey, Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.43,0:01:59.77,main,MIMI DAD,0,0,0,,Are you sure this is all you want \Nto bring back for the prince?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.77,0:02:03.17,main,MIMI DAD,0,0,0,,We have sheep and whole roast cows.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.17,0:02:05.77,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Those are both large animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.77,0:02:07.77,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I'll just take what \NI can fit in the carriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.77,0:02:10.48,main,MIMI DAD,0,0,0,,But he'll eat through this in no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.48,0:02:12.90,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,No, he won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.90,0:02:15.04,main,MIMI DAD,0,0,0,,But hunger ruins gains.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.04,0:02:17.74,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,The prince isn't trying to build muscle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.74,0:02:21.57,main,IDEA,0,0,0,,Their relationship's back \Nto how it used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.57,0:02:23.33,main,NINA,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.28,0:02:27.12,main,MIMI MOM,0,0,0,,What a tomboyish crown princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.13,0:02:31.88,main,TEO,0,0,0,,She's leaving? I'll miss her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.42,0:02:34.09,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\move(265,70,265,60)\c&H151B19&\3c&HFFFFFF&\shad0\fad(40,25)}COME
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.13,0:02:34.84,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\move(65,210,60,200)\c&H151B19&\3c&HFFFFFF&\shad0\fad(40,25)}COME
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.21,0:02:36.87,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Teo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.87,0:02:40.46,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,It's all right. I'll be back soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.46,0:02:44.85,main,TEO,0,0,0,,Really? Then I'll be a good boy and wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.85,0:02:48.48,main,TEO,0,0,0,,I'll escort you to your carriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.99,0:02:51.05,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Oh, no. He's too cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.05,0:02:52.82,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I wish I could take him with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.15,0:02:55.01,main,MIMI MOM,0,0,0,,That's a terrifying expression.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.86,0:02:59.53,main,TEO,0,0,0,,Take my hand, milady.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.86,0:03:00.87,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Yes, milord.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.73,0:03:04.79,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Let's go, future duke.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.18,0:03:07.79,main,TEO,0,0,0,,Open the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.71,0:03:13.21,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Thank you for the lovely escort.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.22,0:03:18.72,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,You just need to train \Nat your own pace, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.45,0:03:20.49,main,TEO,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.54,0:03:23.59,main,IDEA,0,0,0,,Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.59,0:03:25.68,main,NINA,0,0,0,,Give our regards to the prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.31,0:03:30.44,main,STUDENTS,0,0,0,,To Lady Maria's departure!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.44,0:03:33.56,main,STUDENTS,0,0,0,,Take care!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.16,0:03:38.07,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I'll be back soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.56,0:03:38.77,top,ALL,0,0,0,,Maria! Maria! Maria!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.77,0:03:42.55,top,ALL,0,0,0,,Maria! Maria! Maria!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.11,0:03:42.55,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Honestly, it's not like we'll \Nnever see each other again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.46,0:03:52.23,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, I wonder if \Nthat village found their missing girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.23,0:03:54.84,main,GOFFREDO,0,0,0,,You mean Navarro Village?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.84,0:03:57.51,flashback,CARLO,0,0,0,,What a kind lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.51,0:03:59.53,flashback,VILLAGER A,0,0,0,,This might actually work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.53,0:04:02.35,flashback,VILLAGER B,0,0,0,,We're real lucky fer shore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.35,0:04:04.81,main,MACCHIO,0,0,0,,I wonder what happened after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.81,0:04:07.48,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,We'll be in the area. Let's stop by.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.61,0:04:19.36,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,What a lovely smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.96,0:04:23.20,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.73,0:04:26.50,main,CARLO,0,0,0,,Milady? What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.96,0:04:33.71,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I see. You haven't found her yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.71,0:04:35.13,main,CARLO,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.13,0:04:38.72,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,And you have no idea where she went?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.63,0:04:42.76,main,CARLO,0,0,0,,Actually, someone saw \NVeronica, the chief's daughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.76,0:04:46.89,main,CARLO,0,0,0,,getting into Count Nardi's carriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.89,0:04:49.42,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,What? You mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.42,0:04:52.86,main,VILLAGER A,0,0,0,,Hey! Terrible news!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.60,0:04:57.18,main,VILLAGER A,0,0,0,,You're that noble lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.18,0:04:59.24,main,VILLAGER A,0,0,0,,Thank you again for helping us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.24,0:05:00.74,main,CARLO,0,0,0,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.74,0:05:05.58,main,VILLAGER A,0,0,0,,I just went to check \Non Count Nardi's mansion, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.92,0:05:10.68,flashback,BANDIT HENCHMAN,0,0,0,,Just hand over the crops!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.68,0:05:12.04,flashback,GUARD,0,0,0,,I told you to leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.04,0:05:15.83,flashback,BANDIT BOSS,0,0,0,,You think you can talk to us like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.83,0:05:18.88,flashback,BANDIT BOSS,0,0,0,,We'll report this to Count Vesentini.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.73,0:05:25.93,main,VILLAGER A,0,0,0,,They were arguing with \Nsome nasty-looking guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.93,0:05:28.70,main,CARLO,0,0,0,,Some thugs showed up at the mansion?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.70,0:05:32.49,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Who's Count Vesentini?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.49,0:05:37.83,main,VILLAGER A,0,0,0,,A customer who buys our \Ncrops from Count Nardi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.83,0:05:39.23,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.23,0:05:46.10,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Count Nardi gathers up this village's \Ncrops and sells them to Count Vesentini?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.10,0:05:46.99,main,VILLAGER A,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.16,0:05:51.16,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,Sounds like a dispute between counts.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.09,0:05:53.33,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,This smells suspect.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.33,0:05:55.63,main,CARLO,0,0,0,,What? Does something smell bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.63,0:05:58.63,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Oh, did I say that out loud?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.63,0:06:01.22,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I didn't mean it like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.22,0:06:03.14,main,CARLO,0,0,0,,It must be our crops.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.14,0:06:03.80,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.17,0:06:06.22,main,CARLO,0,0,0,,This is what we grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.22,0:06:08.76,main,CARLO,0,0,0,,It has a unique smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.76,0:06:10.98,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.27,0:06:10.51,sign_TrebuchetMS,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(222,91)\frz8.25\c&H3C3E45&\3c&HFBFEFF&\shad0}SNIFF
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.27,0:06:10.51,sign_TrebuchetMS,,0,0,0,,{\an8\frz8.25\c&H3C3E45&\3c&HFBFEFF&\shad0\pos(577,182)}SNIFF
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.51,0:06:10.76,sign_TrebuchetMS,,0,0,0,,{\frz-17.35\c&H3C3E45&\3c&HFBFEFF&\shad0\pos(217,57)}SNIFF
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.51,0:06:10.76,sign_TrebuchetMS,,0,0,0,,{\frz17.28\c&H3C3E45&\3c&HFBFEFF&\shad0\pos(548,116)}SNIFF
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.76,0:06:11.01,sign_TrebuchetMS,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(222,91)\frz8.25\c&H3C3E45&\3c&HFBFEFF&\shad0}SNIFF
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.76,0:06:11.01,sign_TrebuchetMS,,0,0,0,,{\an8\frz8.25\c&H3C3E45&\3c&HFBFEFF&\shad0\pos(580,185)}SNIFF
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.01,0:06:11.27,sign_TrebuchetMS,,0,0,0,,{\frz-17.35\c&H3C3E45&\3c&HFBFEFF&\shad0\pos(217,57)}SNIFF
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.01,0:06:11.27,sign_TrebuchetMS,,0,0,0,,{\frz17.28\c&H3C3E45&\3c&HFBFEFF&\shad0\pos(548,116)}SNIFF
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.29,0:06:12.35,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,It stinks!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.35,0:06:17.94,main,CARLO,0,0,0,,Doesn't it? This is all we \Ncan grow in our poor soil.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.94,0:06:20.57,main,CARLO,0,0,0,,It's processed into a spice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.99,0:06:25.99,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,But why? I smelled a pleasant aroma \Nwhen I entered the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.99,0:06:28.39,main,CARLO,0,0,0,,We don't know why,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.39,0:06:33.04,main,CARLO,0,0,0,,but when this plant is smelled \Nwhile flowering, the scent is like citrus.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.59,0:06:37.96,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,You're right. That smells nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.50,0:06:41.21,main,CARLO,0,0,0,,This is all our village has.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.64,0:06:43.57,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I wouldn't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.57,0:06:48.74,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,You must be very worried that a girl \Nwent missing from this peaceful village.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.74,0:06:49.76,main,CARLO,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.76,0:06:55.94,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,From what I gather, Count Nardi \Nmust know something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.94,0:06:59.78,main,CARLO,0,0,0,,Yes. We think she was kidnapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.78,0:07:04.17,main,CARLO,0,0,0,,So we're planning \Nto pay the count a visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.17,0:07:09.03,main,VILLAGER A,0,0,0,,Yeah. If those thugs are involved, \Nwe gotta do somethin'!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.99,0:07:13.09,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I'll go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.09,0:07:15.66,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Having a noble on your side \Nwill make a difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.66,0:07:18.38,main,GOFFREDO,0,0,0,,Milady, that's not a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.38,0:07:22.90,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,But I have to do something \Nafter hearing all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.81,0:07:25.55,main,GOFFREDO,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.55,0:07:27.59,main,MACCHIO,0,0,0,,You would say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.23,0:07:30.32,main,CARLO,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.67,0:07:33.06,main,GUARD,0,0,0,,Who are you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.06,0:07:34.39,main,GUARD,0,0,0,,Get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.30,0:07:41.21,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I'm a member of the Annovazzi family.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.21,0:07:43.53,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I'd like to speak with the count.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.53,0:07:46.48,main,GUARD,0,0,0,,You're some high muck-a-muck? Buzz off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.48,0:07:48.91,main,GUARD,0,0,0,,The count's not seeing anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.43,0:07:51.66,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,Buzz off?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.66,0:07:57.28,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,I can't blame him for not knowing \Nthe nobles of a little kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.28,0:07:58.93,main,CARLO,0,0,0,,M-Milady?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.93,0:08:00.66,main,VILLAGER A,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.66,0:08:03.55,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I'm fine. I expected this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.13,0:08:09.30,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,If we can't get through \Nthe front gate, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.25,0:08:13.19,main,MACCHIO,0,0,0,,We don't even know where the girl is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.19,0:08:14.61,main,MACCHIO,0,0,0,,What are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.14,0:08:18.14,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,In buildings like these,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.14,0:08:23.13,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,captives are always held in \Nback rooms on the highest floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.13,0:08:24.40,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.95,0:08:30.44,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Stay here and attract the guards \Nby causing a commotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.44,0:08:32.97,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Gather all the soldiers \Nto the first floor if you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.97,0:08:35.92,main,CARLO,0,0,0,,You're going to enter by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.92,0:08:37.41,main,GOFFREDO,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.41,0:08:41.01,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,A brawny man breaking in \Nwould raise suspicion.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.01,0:08:43.52,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I'll be able to hide myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.44,0:08:50.04,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Macchio, come help me climb.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.45,0:08:57.03,main,MACCHIO,0,0,0,,Very well, milady. Just don't overdo it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.03,0:08:58.53,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.67,0:09:02.13,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I've got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.13,0:09:08.45,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,That said, this is for self-defense only.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.82,0:09:11.51,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,I'd rather avoid violence.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.51,0:09:15.40,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,As long as I avoid running into people...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.55,0:09:24.90,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,H-Hello...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.59,0:09:27.25,main,WOMAN,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.70,0:09:31.26,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.54,0:09:39.33,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,That was a surprise. \NThere was totally someone in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.77,0:09:45.01,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,Well, whatever. I made it to the hallway.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.01,0:09:46.63,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,I'll just keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.63,0:09:48.88,main,SOLDIER B,0,0,0,,All clear. On to the next place.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.88,0:09:51.14,main,SOLDIER A,0,0,0,,Yeah. We haven't checked \Nthe upper floors yet, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.14,0:09:52.10,main,SOLDIER B,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.78,0:09:54.81,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,Two men on the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.50,0:09:59.04,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,One man shirking his duties on the sofa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.04,0:10:03.08,main,SOLDIER A,0,0,0,,Hey, when's the count coming back?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.08,0:10:08.70,main,SOLDIER B,0,0,0,,Who knows? It's been two months since \Nhe went to the capital for a meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.70,0:10:10.38,main,SOLDIER B,0,0,0,,It's really dragging on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.38,0:10:14.18,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,What? Count Nardi's been gone for months?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.18,0:10:16.93,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,Then who kidnapped the girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.73,0:10:22.06,main,SOLDIER A,0,0,0,,Come on, man. Don't fart.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.30,0:10:25.77,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Pee-yoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.11,0:10:27.71,main,SOLDIER B,0,0,0,,What? Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.71,0:10:28.48,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.48,0:10:30.28,main,SOLDIER A,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.36,0:10:36.85,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,That fart wasn't me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.58,0:10:41.80,main,SOFA SOLDIER,0,0,0,,Huh? What's all this noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.75,0:10:45.47,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,This is your fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.96,0:10:55.09,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,I acted without thinking, but I can't \Nlet them think a lady passed gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.09,0:10:56.47,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,Absolutely not.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.95,0:10:58.76,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Is the girl upstairs?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.80,0:11:02.22,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,I'd better hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.65,0:11:16.68,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,She must be on this floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.68,0:11:19.20,main,DOWNSTAIRS SOLDIER,0,0,0,,Hey, who are you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.08,0:11:22.36,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,It's getting noisy downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.36,0:11:25.25,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,Goffredo and the villagers \Nare doing a good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.52,0:11:32.91,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,There are more servants over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.91,0:11:34.97,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,I'd better stay hidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.17,0:11:39.07,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,But then I can't use this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.07,0:11:42.58,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,If I crawl, I won't be ready \Nif the soldiers find me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.12,0:11:44.22,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.49,0:11:51.23,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,Number 41, shuffling.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.23,0:11:52.73,sign_TimesNewRoman,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\3c&H495971&\c&H192229&\an1\frz13.06\pos(18,133)\fs28\shad2\4c&H293542&}Number 41 Shuffling
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.73,0:11:57.44,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,It's a martial arts technique from \Nthe far eastern art of "soo-mow."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.44,0:11:59.74,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,But why is it a secret technique?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.37,0:12:04.90,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,Because it looks a little embarrassing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.90,0:12:09.68,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,As a noble lady and young woman, \NI don't want anyone to see me doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.68,0:12:12.50,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,Absolutely not.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.68,0:12:16.62,main,SOLDIER,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.57,0:12:20.76,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Hello to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.50,0:12:28.44,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Sorry. I couldn't let you go \Nafter you saw that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.44,0:12:32.19,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I'll put you in this storage room.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.75,0:12:45.95,main,VERONICA,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.74,0:12:48.83,main,VERONICA,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.96,0:12:51.83,sign_Verdana,,0,0,0,,{\an9\c&H477FDA&\3c&H2E47A6&\shad0\bord3}Toss
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.33,0:12:56.85,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Are you Veronica of Navarro Village?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.85,0:12:58.41,main,VERONICA,0,0,0,,Y-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.41,0:13:00.79,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Great. I'm here to rescue you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.79,0:13:02.05,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.05,0:13:04.66,main,VERONICA,0,0,0,,What? Rescue me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.35,0:13:08.35,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Someone's coming. Stand back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.19,0:13:12.98,main,HUGO,0,0,0,,I refuse to marry you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.75,0:13:20.08,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,R-Rejected for marriage again!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.94,0:13:25.95,sign_Georgia,,0,0,0,,{\c&H141824&\3c&HFFFFFF&\shad0\bord3\an1\frz11.98\pos(367,247)}Always a {\c&H8873F3&}Catch!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.57,0:13:31.22,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Rejected for marriage again...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.46,0:13:37.97,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I've been rejected twice \Nfor marriages I wasn't aware of.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.97,0:13:40.07,main,HUGO,0,0,0,,Veronica, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.07,0:13:42.34,main,VERONICA,0,0,0,,Yes. Who is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.34,0:13:44.89,main,HUGO,0,0,0,,What? She's not Lady Ella?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.75,0:13:49.17,main,VERONICA,0,0,0,,Um, what's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.17,0:13:50.64,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,It's Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.43,0:13:57.06,main,HUGO,0,0,0,,My apologies. I am Hugo Nardi, \NCount Nardi's son.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.65,0:14:01.72,main,HUGO,0,0,0,,A certain count is demanding \NI marry his daughter
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.72,0:14:04.03,main,HUGO,0,0,0,,in exchange for buying our crops.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.82,0:14:07.99,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,You mean Count Vesentini?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.42,0:14:09.67,main,HUGO,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.67,0:14:14.43,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,So that's why you mistook me \Nfor his daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.79,0:14:17.59,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,You should at least confirm \Nwho you're speaking to
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.59,0:14:19.75,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,before calling off an engagement.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.75,0:14:24.69,main,HUGO,0,0,0,,My heart already belongs to Veronica.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.09,0:14:30.18,main,VERONICA,0,0,0,,Hugo, you should marry Lady Ella \Nfor the village's sake, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.18,0:14:33.61,main,HUGO,0,0,0,,What are you talking about? \NI can't imagine a future without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.61,0:14:34.94,main,VERONICA,0,0,0,,Hugo...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.94,0:14:36.19,main,HUGO,0,0,0,,Veronica...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.19,0:14:37.60,main,VERONICA,0,0,0,,Hugo...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.60,0:14:38.52,main,HUGO,0,0,0,,Veronica...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.52,0:14:42.73,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,So, this wasn't a kidnapping?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.73,0:14:45.86,main,VERONICA,0,0,0,,Did the villagers ask you to come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.14,0:14:50.48,main,HUGO,0,0,0,,I'm terribly sorry for the inconvenience.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.87,0:14:56.00,main,HUGO,0,0,0,,I was actually planning to flee \Nwith her while my father's away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.32,0:15:00.00,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,You mean you were going to elope?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.58,0:15:04.51,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,A forbidden love! An illicit affair!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.51,0:15:06.82,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Two lovebirds put to the test!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.82,0:15:11.83,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I love it so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.83,0:15:14.23,main,VERONICA,0,0,0,,Um, Miss Mimi?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.73,0:15:16.90,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I'll protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.90,0:15:19.89,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I won't allow anyone \Nto tear you lovebirds apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.89,0:15:24.07,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Let's table eloping and \Nreconsider pursuing another future.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.40,0:15:30.08,main,VERONICA,0,0,0,,Thank you. I appreciate the offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.44,0:15:33.68,main,CARLO,0,0,0,,Veronica!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.68,0:15:35.08,main,VILLAGER B,0,0,0,,You're all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.08,0:15:37.75,main,VERONICA,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for making you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.75,0:15:40.21,main,MACCHIO,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're safe as well, milady.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.21,0:15:42.16,main,GOFFREDO,0,0,0,,Not that we were that worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.16,0:15:43.13,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.13,0:15:45.22,main,SOLDIER,0,0,0,,Lord Hugo, terrible news!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.53,0:15:47.18,main,SOLDIER,0,0,0,,The warehouse is under attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.18,0:15:48.34,main,HUGO,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.92,0:15:50.18,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.14,0:15:53.39,main,HUGO,0,0,0,,Them again?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.39,0:15:56.72,main,BANDIT BOSS,0,0,0,,We're taking everything in the warehouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.72,0:16:00.92,main,BANDIT BOSS,0,0,0,,Count Vesentini will \Nbuy it at a high price.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.92,0:16:03.44,main,BANDIT BOSS,0,0,0,,Stealing costs us nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.44,0:16:06.06,main,BANDIT BOSS,0,0,0,,All the profits are ours to keep.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.75,0:16:09.81,main,BANDIT BOSS,0,0,0,,Hand over whatever you've got, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.81,0:16:14.42,main,BANDIT BOSS,0,0,0,,This important deal will \Ndetermine your future.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.58,0:16:18.33,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Lord Hugo, this isn't a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.25,0:16:21.88,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,You don't have to hand over \Nyour precious crops.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.88,0:16:24.92,main,BANDIT BOSS,0,0,0,,Y-Y-You!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.92,0:16:26.73,main,BANDIT BOSS,0,0,0,,You again! What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.73,0:16:28.47,main,HENCHMAN A,0,0,0,,Who is that woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.47,0:16:29.79,main,MACCHIO,0,0,0,,Silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.79,0:16:33.64,main,GOFFREDO,0,0,0,,She's the future crown princess of Rubini.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.64,0:16:35.97,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I am Maria Annovazzi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.97,0:16:38.48,main,ALL,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.09,0:16:41.73,main,CARLO,0,0,0,,She's a genuine princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.73,0:16:46.86,main,VERONICA,0,0,0,,Oh, no. I didn't use your proper title.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.86,0:16:50.80,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,It's fine. We're friends now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.80,0:16:53.25,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,We'll defeat these guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.25,0:16:56.04,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I want you two to be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.04,0:16:58.07,main,HUGO,0,0,0,,Lady Maria...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.33,0:17:01.49,main,HUGO,0,0,0,,That's right, leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.49,0:17:05.54,main,HUGO,0,0,0,,We don't need the count. \NI'll find a new buyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.54,0:17:08.18,main,HUGO,0,0,0,,I won't deal with you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.92,0:17:12.27,main,CARLO,0,0,0,,Yeah. We're not giving you our crops.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.27,0:17:13.80,main,VILLAGER A,0,0,0,,Leave the goods and go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.80,0:17:16.25,main,ALL,0,0,0,,Yeah, leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.25,0:17:17.29,main,ALL,0,0,0,,Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.29,0:17:18.96,main,ALL,0,0,0,,Those crops are ours!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.81,0:17:23.59,main,HENCHMAN A,0,0,0,,B-Boss, what should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.59,0:17:25.82,main,BANDIT BOSS,0,0,0,,Idiots! Don't be scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.32,0:17:32.16,main,BANDIT LEADER,0,0,0,,Hey! How long does it take \Nto shut up one noble brat?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.16,0:17:36.45,main,BANDIT BOSS,0,0,0,,S-Sorry, boss. They're fighting back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.45,0:17:40.12,main,BANDIT BOSS,0,0,0,,And that woman's the one \Nwho got in our way the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.12,0:17:41.29,main,BANDIT LEADER,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.02,0:17:45.54,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Goffredo, Macchio.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.54,0:17:48.38,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,He's no ordinary thug.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.38,0:17:50.53,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,He's got a lot of experience \Nunder his belt.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.53,0:17:53.84,main,BANDIT LEADER,0,0,0,,I've heard about you. I didn't \Nrealize you're just a little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.84,0:17:57.88,main,CARLO,0,0,0,,What? She's the new princess of Rubini!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.88,0:17:59.77,main,CARLO,0,0,0,,Show some respect!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.77,0:18:00.93,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.05,0:18:07.96,main,BANDIT LEADER,0,0,0,,Damn villagers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.96,0:18:11.00,main,BANDIT LEADER,0,0,0,,You've got guts to stand up to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.00,0:18:13.79,main,BANDIT LEADER,0,0,0,,Boys, get the goods out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.13,0:18:17.62,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.62,0:18:21.62,main,BANDIT LEADER,0,0,0,,You're smart enough to understand \Nwhat's going on, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.36,0:18:26.26,main,BANDIT LEADER,0,0,0,,If you want him to live, \Nyou'll stay out of our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.12,0:18:28.63,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.53,0:18:31.79,main,VILLAGER B,0,0,0,,This way, sirs!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.22,0:18:36.05,main,BANDIT LEADER,0,0,0,,What? Knights of Rubini?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.89,0:18:40.18,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Unhand him!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.23,0:18:45.06,main,KNIGHT CAPTAIN,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.06,0:18:47.31,main,BANDIT BOSS,0,0,0,,Boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.10,0:18:50.24,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.24,0:18:52.97,main,CARLO,0,0,0,,Thank you, Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.97,0:18:57.08,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,What are you saying? I'm sorry \Nfor putting you through that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.08,0:18:58.61,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I hope nothing's broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.61,0:19:00.18,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Treat this man right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.18,0:19:01.18,main,KNIGHT,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.18,0:19:03.36,main,KNIGHT CAPTAIN,0,0,0,,Impressive as always, Lady Maria.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.36,0:19:05.29,main,GOFFREDO,0,0,0,,That was a good number 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.29,0:19:07.81,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Thank you. You came.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.81,0:19:10.50,main,KNIGHT CAPTAIN,0,0,0,,Yes. We rushed here after hearing \Nthe plea from the villagers
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.50,0:19:11.80,main,KNIGHT CAPTAIN,0,0,0,,who came to the royal castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.55,0:19:14.59,main,VILLAGER B,0,0,0,,We're glad yous made it in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.59,0:19:17.61,main,KNIGHT CAPTAIN,0,0,0,,And we're not the only ones who came.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.94,0:19:20.35,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Mimi, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.35,0:19:23.18,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Prince Renato? What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.18,0:19:25.46,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Did you come to meet me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.01,0:19:29.11,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Macchio and Goffredo, \Nlet me introduce you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.40,0:19:33.11,main,MACCHIO,0,0,0,,Milady, watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.28,0:19:42.78,main,BANDIT B,0,0,0,,Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.25,0:19:46.55,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,I can't reach him from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.46,0:19:50.72,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.16,0:19:53.71,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,What do I do? What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.20,0:19:55.70,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Renato!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.72,0:19:57.97,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.14,0:20:02.04,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Thirty-eight!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.23,0:20:08.48,main,ALL,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.21,0:20:12.44,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Ouch...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.23,0:20:16.49,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Your Highness, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.49,0:20:17.77,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.77,0:20:19.82,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,No. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.82,0:20:21.48,main,KNIGHT CAPTAIN,0,0,0,,Seize him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.48,0:20:23.16,main,KNIGHT A,0,0,0,,He's unconscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.16,0:20:24.87,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,How...?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.60,0:20:27.29,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,How did I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.66,0:20:29.91,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,I've been secretly practicing
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.91,0:20:33.46,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,the number 38 you showed me \Nthe morning you left.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.50,0:20:37.59,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,But I only showed it to you \Nthat one time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.59,0:20:43.51,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,His Highness punched a man \Nwith his bare hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.37,0:20:47.02,main,KNIGHT,0,0,0,,Lord Raimondo, pull yourself together.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.57,0:20:54.57,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're not hurt, \Nbut please don't do that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.57,0:20:59.24,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,That's right. If anything \Nhappened to you, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.41,0:21:03.91,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you weren't injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.84,0:21:11.75,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Anyway, I had no idea \Npunching someone hurt this much.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.62,0:21:13.79,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Your Highness...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.34,0:21:17.75,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,You have more physical and \Npolitical strength than anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.75,0:21:23.01,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Please remember that the pain \Nyou inflict on others is far greater.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.53,0:21:26.90,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,You must never forget that pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.72,0:21:32.52,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,I'll keep in mind how heavy my fists are.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.52,0:21:36.69,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,But you can also use that power \Nto protect people.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.51,0:21:43.87,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming \Nto save me, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.75,0:21:48.99,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.63,0:22:09.01,sign_Arial,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Translation: Sho Stifler\NTiming: Mariana Martinez
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.01,0:22:13.39,sign_Arial,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Editing: Alicia Ashby\NQuality Control: Ashley Barboza
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.39,0:22:17.73,sign_Arial,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Final Quality Control: Michelle Tymon
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.75,0:23:28.75,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,My little brother Teo loves meat
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.75,0:23:31.38,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,and is a good boy \Nwho eats plenty of everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.38,0:23:33.27,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,I'm sure he'll grow up to be big.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.27,0:23:36.86,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,Dad likes sweet things, \Ndespite how he looks.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.86,0:23:38.89,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,Oh, I spoke my mind again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.30,0:23:30.22,sign_Verdana,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\c&H6384F9&\3c&H526DD1&\shad0\bord2\fs25\pos(186,114)\fad(233,1)}GLOW
